{
  "id": "ACT.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Incito 23",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walo Paulo wakabalangisisya basilubeta wakati, Nobakwesu, ndakeenda amoyo mubotu kumbele lya-Leza mane kusikila buzuba buno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoonya Hananiya, mupaizi mupati, wakalailila mbaakaimvwi abo kuti bamuume kumulomo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Paulo wakati kulinguwe, Leza ulakuuma yebo obwaanda butubye, Sena ulakala kundibeteka camulao, kumwi ulailila kuti ndyuumwe icitali camulao? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakaimvwi mpawo batateeti, Sena utukila mupaizi mupati wa-Leza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo wakaamba kuti, Nsendali kuzi, bakwesu, kuti ngomupaizi mupati, nkaambo kwakalembwa kuti, Utaambi bubi amweendelezi wacisi cakwanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele Paulo naakabona kuti bamwi mba-Saduki abamwi mba-Farisi, wakoompolola mulubeta wakati, Nobakwesu, ndili mu-Farisi mebo, mwana aba-Farisi, ndabetekwa nkaambo kakusyoma bubuke bwabafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naakaamba obo, kwakaba kukazyanya akati kabaFarisi aba-Saduki, embungano yakaandaana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkaambo ba-Saduki bati, Takukwe kubuka kulufu, nobaba baangelo, nuuba muuya, kwala ba-Farisi bazumina oonse aya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndilyonya kwakaba kuyoba kupati, bamwi balembi bakuba-Farisi bakanyamuka, bakazya bati, Tatujene bubi kumuntu oyu. Anooli muuya uwaamba kulinguwe, na angelo, makaninzi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo nokwakaba kuzwangana kupati, musolozi oyo mupati, mbwaakayoowa kuti Paulo balamukwamuna, wakalailila basilumamba kuti bainke bakamugwisye cenguzu kulimbabo, akumutola mukati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eno nokwakaba masiku Mwami wakamwiiminina wakati, Kojatisya, mbuli mbokandilungulula mu-Jerusalemu, mbubonya obo uyoondilungulula aku-Roma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nobwakaca ba-Juda bakabungana, balyaanga akukonka kuti tabakoolya akunywa kabatana kumujaya Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo abakalyaanga obo bakainda kumakumi one. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela bakainka kubapaizi basimutwe akubapati bakati, Twalyaanga akukonka kuti tatukooyoolabila cintu, katutana kumujaya Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaako eno nywebo, antoomwe abasilubeta, mukumbile musolozi mupati kuti akamulete kulindinywe, kubaanke kuli ncomuyanda kumubuzisya kabotu, aswebo katanaswena afwaafwi tunoolibambilide kumujaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele mwana amucizi wa-Paulo wakabamvwa akumulindila kwabo, wakainka wanjila omo mwaakabede, waambila Paulo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndilyonya Paulo wakaita umwi wabasunguli wakati, Tola mulombe oyu kumusolozi mupati, nkaambo ujisi makani aakumwaambila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wakamubweza, wamutola kumusolozi mupati wati, Paulo mwaange wandiita, wakumbila kuti ndilete mulombe oyu kulinduwe, ujisi makani aakukwaambila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoonya musolozi mupati wakamujata ejanza, wamutola, wamubuzya kumbali kuti, Ino makaninzi ngojisi kundyaambila? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walo wakateeti, Ba-Juda bakazuminana kukumbila kulinduwe kuti ijunza umutole Paulo kulubeta, mbuli kuti bali ncobayanda kumubuzisya kabotu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele utabazuminini yebo, nkaambo kulimbabo kuli baalumi abainda makumi one, abamulindilide, abakalyaanga akukonka kuti tabakoolya akunywa, kabatana kumujaya. Aneeno balilibambilide, balalangila cisyomezyo cako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela musolozi mupati wakaleka mulombe oyo, wamulailila kuti, Utaambili muntu kuti wandizibya makani aya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoonya awo wakaita basunguli bobile wakati, Amululamike basilumamba abali myaanda yobile, abasimbizi abali makumi aali musanu mwaabili, abasimasumo abali myaanda yobile, kuti bainke kuKaisareya kuciindi caciizizyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mubape embelesa, kuti bamutantike Paulo, bakamusisye kabotu kuli-Felike mweendelezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela wakalemba lugwalo lwakuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Klaudiyo Lusiya nguulembela Felike, mweendelezi mulemu. Ndakwaanzya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyu mwaalumi wakajatwa ba-Juda. Bati kamujaye, pele ndakasika abasilumamba ndamuvuna, nendakamvwa kuti mu-Roma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwendakali kuyanda kuziba kaambo nkobamubika, ndakamutola kulubeta lwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oko ndakajana wabikwa kaambo kamibuzyo yamulao wabo, pele tajisi mulandu uuelede kufwa na kwaangwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nendakamvwa kuti bavwiyana kufumpa oyu muntu, ndilyonya ndamutumina kulinduwe, ndalailila abo abamubika kaambo kuzooamba mulandu wakwe kulinduwe. Kosyaala kabotu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
